<?xml version="1.0"?>
<ScenContainer xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" xmlns:xsd="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema">
  <ScenTitle>Mission 2013D Part 1, 2014</ScenTitle>
  <ScenDescription>&lt;BODY scroll=auto&gt;&lt;SPAN style="WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FLOAT: none; COLOR: rgb(51,51,51); TEXT-ALIGN: justify; FONT: 10px/14px Verdana, sans-serif; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(235,235,235); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FLOAT: none; COLOR: rgb(51,51,51); TEXT-ALIGN: justify; FONT: 10px/14px Verdana, sans-serif; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(235,235,235); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;?xml:namespace prefix = "st1" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:smarttags" /&gt;&lt;st1:country-region w:st="on"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;FONT size=3&gt;V2.0 Tested Command V1.04 B536&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/st1:country-region&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;st1:country-region w:st="on"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB"&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/st1:country-region&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;st1:country-region w:st="on"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;FONT size=3&gt;China PLAN / PLAAF&amp;nbsp;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/st1:country-region&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;st1:country-region w:st="on"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;FONT size=3&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/st1:country-region&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;st1:country-region w:st="on"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;FONT size=3&gt;ROC / USAF / USN&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/st1:country-region&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;st1:country-region w:st="on"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB"&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/st1:country-region&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB"&gt;&lt;?xml:namespace prefix = "o" ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN&gt;Date/Time:&amp;nbsp;Mar 2014&amp;nbsp;/ 22:00:00 Zulu / 06:00:00 Local&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN&gt;Location: &lt;st1:place w:st="on"&gt;&lt;st1:PlaceType w:st="on"&gt;North Taiwan Straight&lt;/st1:PlaceType&gt;&lt;/st1:place&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN&gt;Playable Sides: &lt;st1:country-region w:st="on"&gt;&lt;st1:place w:st="on"&gt;United States&lt;/st1:place&gt;&lt;/st1:country-region&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB"&gt;&lt;STRONG&gt;&lt;FONT size=2&gt;Introduction&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/FONT&gt;&lt;/STRONG&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P class=MsoNormal style="MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt"&gt;&lt;SPAN lang=EN-GB style="mso-ansi-language: EN-GB"&gt;&lt;o:p&gt;2013 China&lt;/o:p&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN style="WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FLOAT: none; COLOR: rgb(51,51,51); TEXT-ALIGN: justify; FONT: 10px/14px Verdana, sans-serif; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(235,235,235); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FLOAT: none; COLOR: rgb(51,51,51); TEXT-ALIGN: justify; FONT: 10px/14px Verdana, sans-serif; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(235,235,235); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;In September,2013,&amp;nbsp; China commenced Mission 2013A, involved more than 40,000 troops from multiple services aimed at a large-scale island invasion either in the South China Sea or East China Sea where China has encountered strong resistance to its claims of territorial or maritime assets.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;BR style="BORDER-TOP: 0px; BORDER-RIGHT: 0px; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; BORDER-BOTTOM: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; COLOR: rgb(51,51,51); PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-TOP: 0px; FONT: 10px/14px Verdana, sans-serif; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; BORDER-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; LETTER-SPACING: normal; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(235,235,235); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;BR style="BORDER-TOP: 0px; BORDER-RIGHT: 0px; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; BORDER-BOTTOM: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; COLOR: rgb(51,51,51); PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-TOP: 0px; FONT: 10px/14px Verdana, sans-serif; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; BORDER-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; LETTER-SPACING: normal; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(235,235,235); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN style="WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FLOAT: none; COLOR: rgb(51,51,51); TEXT-ALIGN: justify; FONT: 10px/14px Verdana, sans-serif; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(235,235,235); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;Following 2013A came Code-named Mission 2013B.The exercises&amp;nbsp;were the third installment&amp;nbsp;in 2013&amp;nbsp;of a series of military drills. Participating in the exercise are ground troops from the 42nd Army of the Guangzhou Military Region command — the military’s crack force that was the main fighting unit during the Korean War and the 1979 invasion of Vietnam.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;BR style="BORDER-TOP: 0px; BORDER-RIGHT: 0px; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; BORDER-BOTTOM: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; COLOR: rgb(51,51,51); PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-TOP: 0px; FONT: 10px/14px Verdana, sans-serif; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; BORDER-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; LETTER-SPACING: normal; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(235,235,235); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;BR style="BORDER-TOP: 0px; BORDER-RIGHT: 0px; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; BORDER-BOTTOM: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; COLOR: rgb(51,51,51); PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-TOP: 0px; FONT: 10px/14px Verdana, sans-serif; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; BORDER-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; LETTER-SPACING: normal; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(235,235,235); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FLOAT: none; COLOR: rgb(51,51,51); TEXT-ALIGN: justify; FONT: 10px/14px Verdana, sans-serif; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(235,235,235); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;Air force units, surface warships and amphibious vessels, and electronic warfare groups from the Guangzhou and Nanjing region commands also formed a key portion of the war games.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;BR style="BORDER-TOP: 0px; BORDER-RIGHT: 0px; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; BORDER-BOTTOM: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; COLOR: rgb(51,51,51); PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-TOP: 0px; FONT: 10px/14px Verdana, sans-serif; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; BORDER-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; LETTER-SPACING: normal; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(235,235,235); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;BR style="BORDER-TOP: 0px; BORDER-RIGHT: 0px; WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; BORDER-BOTTOM: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; COLOR: rgb(51,51,51); PADDING-BOTTOM: 0px; TEXT-ALIGN: justify; PADDING-TOP: 0px; FONT: 10px/14px Verdana, sans-serif; PADDING-LEFT: 0px; BORDER-LEFT: 0px; MARGIN: 0px; LETTER-SPACING: normal; PADDING-RIGHT: 0px; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(235,235,235); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;SPAN style="WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FLOAT: none; COLOR: rgb(51,51,51); TEXT-ALIGN: justify; FONT: 10px/14px Verdana, sans-serif; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(235,235,235); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;A third exercise, Mission 2013C, was conducted and directed primarily by the air force.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN style="WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FLOAT: none; COLOR: rgb(51,51,51); TEXT-ALIGN: justify; FONT: 10px/14px Verdana, sans-serif; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(235,235,235); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;US INTEL confirmed the existance of a 2013 Delta exercise but it never was executed by China.&lt;/SPAN&gt;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;&lt;SPAN style="WHITE-SPACE: normal; WORD-SPACING: 0px; TEXT-TRANSFORM: none; FLOAT: none; COLOR: rgb(51,51,51); TEXT-ALIGN: justify; FONT: 10px/14px Verdana, sans-serif; DISPLAY: inline !important; LETTER-SPACING: normal; BACKGROUND-COLOR: rgb(235,235,235); TEXT-INDENT: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px"&gt;&lt;/SPAN&gt;Dec 2013&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;China's J20 program delivers an undisclosed number of aircraft to PLA air force for operational deployment.&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;Jan 2014&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;China accelerated the activation of its newest carrier the Shi Lang.&amp;nbsp;Air assets&amp;nbsp;were delivered and deemed carrier combat operational.&amp;nbsp;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;Feb 2014&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;China alerts international community and warns commercial traffic of its intent to hold a multi service exercise and evaluate its new naval structure in March. US / ROC plan joint exercise.&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;Mar&amp;nbsp;2014&lt;/P&gt;
&lt;P&gt;1700Z. As US and ROC forces exercise into the third day of a week long&amp;nbsp;joint naval operation&amp;nbsp; some 150 miles east of the Taiwan straight, China&amp;nbsp;executes mission 2013D. It is soon clear this is no excersise....&lt;/P&gt;&lt;/BODY&gt;</ScenDescription>
